flowchart LR
    Call["BPF program calls<br/>bpf_copy_from_user(buf, sz, user_ptr)"]
    Check["page table lookup<br/>for user_ptr"]
    Mapped{Page in memory?}
    Copy["copy bytes to buf<br/>return 0"]
    Fault["page fault!<br/>need to page in"]
    Sched{Sleepable<br/>context?}
    Wait["context yields<br/>kernel pages in<br/>BPF resumes"]
    Crash["context can't yield<br/>helper returns -EFAULT"]

    Call --> Check
    Check --> Mapped
    Mapped -->|yes| Copy
    Mapped -->|no| Fault
    Fault --> Sched
    Sched -->|yes, .s/ program| Wait
    Sched -->|no, normal| Crash
    Wait --> Copy

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Copy,Wait ok
    class Crash bad
    class Mapped,Sched hot
